        <mxCell id="invariants" value="Invariantes Críticas (PT §4, §16):&#xA;● Competition: DRAFT→ACTIVE→CLOSED terminal en V1&#xA;● Cerrar Competition RECHAZA si ∃ CompetitionEntry ACTIVE (explicando cuáles)&#xA;● CompetitionEntry: TEAM y LINE son ALCANCES DE DATO, no estados (PT §4)&#xA;● TEAM scope: identifica teamId; unique {competitionId, teamId}&#xA;● LINE scope: identifica divisionId+lineId+seasonId&#xA;● TEAM y LINE INCOMPATIBLES → COMPETITION_SCOPE_MISMATCH&#xA;● Uso en Match: scope compatible con Jornada (PT §16)&#xA;  - TEAM: entry.teamId == match.concreteTeam&#xA;  - LINE: entry.seasonId == match.team.seasonId ∧ entry.lineId == match.team.lineId&#xA;● ReferenceAdmissionFence: EndCompetitionEntry serializa vs nuevos Matches&#xA;● ExternalReference: target whitelist (COMPETITION/COMPETITION_ENTRY/MATCH_EVENT)&#xA;● Límite federativo: referencia ES referencia, NO verdad federativa (REQ-CMP-007)&#xA;● Subcomisión/Admin gestionan; Coach solo lectura referencias (UC-CMP-09)&#xA;● EligibilityConstraint scope COMPETITION/ENTRY aplica aquí (R-38, R-39)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF8E1;strokeColor=#F57F17;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="700" width="550" height="250" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sources" value="Fuentes:&#xA;PT §4, §16, §25&#xA;REQ-CMP-001 a 008&#xA;UC-CMP-01 a 09&#xA;SM-COMPETITION-01, SM-COMPETITIONENTRY-01&#xA;R-50 a R-57" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECEFF1;strokeColor=#37474F;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="600" y="700" width="300" height="125" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note-inheritance" value="NOTA: CompetitionEntry TEAM y LINE NO son subclases UML.&#xA;Son scopes de dato en una misma clase (CompetitionEntry.scope).&#xA;PT §4: 'TEAM y LINE son alcances de dato, no etapas de lifecycle'." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#2E7D32;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="880" y="355" width="260" height="80" as="geometry" />
